### Submit a valid trade (gateway)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8081/api/trades
Content-Type: application/json

{"account": "ACC-1", "symbol": "INFY", "side": "BUY", "quantity": 100, "price": 1520.50}

### Submit a trade that breaks the notional limit (processor will REJECT it)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8081/api/trades
Content-Type: application/json

{"account": "ACC-1", "symbol": "TCS", "side": "SELL", "quantity": 10000, "price": 4100}

### Invalid input (gateway returns 400)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8081/api/trades
Content-Type: application/json

{"account": "", "symbol": "INFY", "side": "BUY", "quantity": 0, "price": -1}

### Look up one trade (paste a tradeId from the responses above)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8083/api/trades/PASTE-TRADE-ID

### All trades for an account
GET http://127.0.0.1:8083/api/accounts/ACC-1/trades

### Positions for an account
GET http://127.0.0.1:8083/api/accounts/ACC-1/positions

### Health / readiness (what Kubernetes will call)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8082/actuator/health/readiness
